    "Caller contract: allocation is a lane prefix within LSQ readiness and four-slot ROB space; kinds are exclusive; retirement is a lane prefix in ROB order and a store retires only with address and data; flush and recovery exclude each other and exclude allocation and retirement; recovery keeps a live slot; load take only with offer.",
