  "environment": [
    "Independent reference ROB window (four slots, two generation bits) records kind, identity, and resolved address/data per slot from the same input events.",
    "Load offer, identity, masks, forwarded bytes and extended result are computed by an oldest-first, youngest-older-store search in ROB order, then the retired-store entries youngest (highest index) first. DUT ranks, pointers and selector outputs are never used by the reference."
  ],
